.cloop/

# Go
*.test
*.out
vendor/

# A separate project that happens to live here.
#
# polyauth/ is its own Go module (github.com/blechschmidt/polyauth) with no
# .git of its own, so to this repository it looks like 191 MB of untracked
# files — including two built binaries. Unignored, the `git add -A` in the
# standing commit instructions would vacuum an unrelated project into cloop's
# history, where removing it again means a rewrite. Ignoring it is not a
# judgement about the code; it is a fence between two projects sharing a
# directory.
polyauth/

# Documentation site: the staged tree, the rendered site and the pinned venv
# `make docs-site` builds. All of it is derived from docs/ and website/.
dist/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
